  <item>
    <title>024 | 国产爱情剧OST：浪漫气息渗透在每一个毛孔里</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6874f40660f8f77d4075e2ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6874f40660f8f77d4075e2ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Jul 2025 12:16:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨大家好久不见！没有更新和上线的日子里都在手忙脚乱忙自己的课题报告。那晚开完组会累得不行，瘫在床上和福星组聊天，一起回味了每一部在我们心中荡起涟漪的国产爱情剧。每天挂在热搜上的bl分分钟就能卷出一个爆款热搜，与之对比的，我们已经很久没有看到过打动我们的国产异性恋故事了。让人不得不感叹把异性恋故事讲好实在是一件不简单的事情，它有着特定的气味、温度、颜色、旋律还有季节，好的故事真的能让人透过2D的屏幕360度无死角感受到主角之间彼此的唯一性，让人撇着嘴角流着眼泪也会说出“爱真好啊爱有无穷力量”。一起跟随旋律荡漾在浪漫气息里：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>我可能不会爱你（2011）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 我不会喜欢你-陈柏霖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 踮起脚尖爱-洪佩瑜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> 还是会-韦礼安</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> 翅膀-林依晨</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>何以笙箫默（2015）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 何以爱情-钟汉良</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> 不将就-李荣浩</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> 孤独的总和-吴汶芳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1871">31:11</a> My Sunshine-张杰</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a> 好久不见-陈奕迅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 遇见你的时候所有星星落在我头上-高姗</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>最好的我们（2016）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 耿耿于怀-王笑文</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>你好，旧时光（2017）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">47:50</a> 时光遐想-许飞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> 遥远的歌-刘惜君</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>想见你（2019）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a> 想见你想见你想见你-八三夭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3519">58:39</a> 一天-Yellow黄宣</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3768">01:02:48</a> Last Dance-伍佰&amp;China Blue</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4039">01:07:19</a> Someday or One Day-孙盛希</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>亲爱的，热爱的（2019）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4292">01:11:32</a> 无名之辈-陈雪燃</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4554">01:15:54</a> 给未来-李现</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4792">01:19:52</a> 牛奶面包-杨紫</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>点燃我，温暖你（2022）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5000">01:23:20</a> Falling You-曾可妮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5223">01:27:03</a> 国王与骑士-陈雪燃</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>爱情而已（2023）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5424">01:30:24</a> 爱情而已-杨丞琳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5644">01:34:04</a> 反客为主-刘宇宁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5857">01:37:37</a> 狼狈-余佳运</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6080">01:41:20</a> 闪耀-水果星球</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>去有风的地方（2023）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6276">01:44:36</a> 去有风的地方-郁可唯</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6508">01:48:28</a> 摇篮曲-斯斯与帆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6689">01:51:29</a> A Beautiful Smile-金玟岐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6922">01:55:22</a> 日日（Days）-陈粒</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>节目最后推荐友台--偶们大福星组成员关耳朵老师的相同主题</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686f9d7260f8f77d40d8b88b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686f9d7260f8f77d40d8b88b"><span>耳朵出口-国产剧ost</span></a><span>，希望大家听得开心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>*歌曲版权归创作者所有</span></p>]]></description>
