  <item>
    <title>023 | 时寐城市限定：潮水向我涌来时，我在时间里假寐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fcbe17623bc78c398a82fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fcbe17623bc78c398a82fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 08:05:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>嗨，大家好久好久不见。其实已经很久没点开节目后台了，偶然点开发现有好几个友友在评论区给我留言，哈特软软又觉得实在太不好意思。前一段很长的时间里都在忙自己的升学考试，复试只考了三天但像漫长的三年，深夜和凌晨也不知道分界点在哪儿，手忙脚乱心跳加速的时候依旧在循环安溥《最好的时光》和《小小之歌》，音乐就是有这样强大的磁场和魔力。</span><br><span>复试最后一天的面试考刚好是潮水箴言首场开票的日子，我总觉得冥冥之中她一定会给我好运。现在潮水箴言终于开演，看完大家的Repo我终于下定决心不再拖沓，重新捡起这期躺在我的草稿箱里很久的时寐城市限定，在潮水停下涌动的缝隙里，我们先在时间里假寐：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 留下来陪你生活</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> Love，New Year</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 亲爱的</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> Make You Feel My Love</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> Beautiful Woman</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 这世界如此美好</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 外婆桥</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a> Have I Told You Lately That I Love You</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> 日子</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 无与伦比的美丽</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2656">44:16</a> Wish You Were Here</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">49:27</a> 女人花</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3202">53:22</a> 决定</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3443">57:23</a> 无状态</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3754">01:02:34</a> live酒馆300秒</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3998">01:06:38</a> All Things Must Pass</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4210">01:10:10</a> I Still Haven't Found What I'm Looking For</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4431">01:13:51</a> 乌鸦</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4915">01:21:55</a> 爱我别走</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5193">01:26:33</a> 你怎么想</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>*歌曲版权归创作者所有</span></em></p>]]></description>
