    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>蝉鸣聒噪的夏天里，总是想到韩剧里一些清凉却爱意盈满的夏日热恋镜头，鬼使神差文艺复兴的时候惊觉这些OST就像是她们热恋夏季里清凉的水汽，拥有降温的魔力。一起听：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《太阳的后裔》</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Everytime-CHEN&amp;Punch</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>다시너를-Mad Clown&amp;金娜英</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>말해!뭐해-K.Will</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>이사랑- DAVICHI(다비치)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>《没关系，是爱情啊》</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>괜찮아사랑이야-DAVICHI(다비치）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>잠 못드는밤-Crush&amp;Punch</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>최고의 행운-CHEN</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>《春夜》</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>NoDirection- Rachael Yamagata</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Rain leaves- Kevin Salem</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Spring Rain-Oscar&nbsp;Dunbar</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Spring Waltz- Carla Bruni</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>봄밤(Spring Night)- Kim Feel</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>《二十五，二十一》</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BIBI - 아주, 천천히</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>DK - Go!</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Wonstein - 존재만으로</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Xydo - 가보자</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>白基成 - 눈이 부시도록 너를 비춰줄게</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>朴志效 - Stardust love song</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>泰一 - Starlight</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>《背着善宰跑》</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>10cm - 春雪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Eclipse - 会见面的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Jae Yeon - 独白</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Minnie - Like A Dream</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>柳会胜 - 是那样吧 (I Think I Did)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>《毕业》</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Simple Melody</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Restless Age - Catch Me</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Restless Age - Don't Forget About Me</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Restless Age - Now and Then</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Restless Age - Together With You</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>所以听友们还有其它的夏季电子冰块供我食用吗！请多多给我推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>*歌曲版权归创作者所有</span></p>]]></description>
