    <title>011 | 春眠歌单：春困春困春困，挨不住了就眠</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6620940048c40e2fb0116d0c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6620940048c40e2fb0116d0c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 03:31:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>太困了太困了每天都非常困，实在想不到阳光刚刚好温度刚刚好的天气里还有什么比睡觉更舒服了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>午睡经常会开着音乐睡觉，但总是被随机歌单里的某些歌曲大声摇滚的节奏或者高亢的音调猛然吓醒，想着要是专门有不会被吵醒的歌单就好了，于是做了这期自用春眠歌单，一起舒服睡觉：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> What Was I made for-BIllie EIlish</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 夏夜晚风-HUSH</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> Dear You-昨夜派对</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> Don't You-布朗尼</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 路边野餐-Aliosha</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 宝贝-张悬</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">23:34</a> 树屋-椅子乐团</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">27:08</a> silent-Sam Ock</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> Supermarket Flower-Amber</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">34:54</a> Alright-Gracie Abrams</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2239">37:19</a> 安静的小时候-柯泯薰</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2561">42:41</a> 南国的孩子-张悬</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> 阿峰今天没有来-万芳</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">53:18</a> 日落玄武湖-郑兴</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3487">58:07</a> 晒乾-柯泯薰</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3737">01:02:17</a> 寻人启事-徐佳莹</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4014">01:06:54</a> 鱼仔-卢广仲</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>封面来自最好的朋友ww逛公园的眼睛，愿望是想在这样惬意的绿色里睡上一大觉。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝大家睡个好觉！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*歌曲版权归创作者所有</span></p>]]></description>
